  "title": {
    "zh": "增加自定义受众",
    "en": "AddCustomAudienceUser"
  },
  "descriptions": {
    "zh": "增加的自定义受众用户提交到meta后，meta如果匹配成功的用户量少于100，他们会扔掉这次的匹配数据，这样做是为了防止提交的号码与token做比对，从而得到直接关系，接口最多一次可以传入10000条用户数据",
    "en": "After users are submitted to a custom audience, Meta matches them. If fewer than 100 users are matched, Meta discards the data. This prevents phone numbers from being linked directly to user tokens. Each API call supports up to 10,000 user records."
  }
